.
.  Generate sample output for Double Exponetial Inverse Survival plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na dexisurv.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Double Exponential Inverse Survival
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
X1LABEL Probability
Y1LABEL X
.
PLOT DEXPPF(1-P) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp DEXISURV.PS dexisurv.ps
system rm DEXISURV.PS
.
quit
